-- A row of four oil cells with a numerical aquifer of two cells attached to
-- the first one. The aquifer cells lie above the water-oil contact and start
-- at 30 bar above the equilibrium pressure, so water flows into the
-- reservoir until the pressures even out. There are no wells.

